wer)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit and creating a frozen area at the far end.\n\nThe area deals a total of 225<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+75% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies within and freezes them for 1s (increases by 0.06s for every 100 Magic Power)."}, {"name": "Frigid Glacier", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_42818d794bbe6206d10e9658013ab033.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50   Mana Cost: 140", "desc": "Aurora creates a frost path in the target direction, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the path and slowing them by 80% for 1.2s. \n\nThe frost path gradually expands into a glacier that shatters at maximum size, dealing 600<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemies in the area and freezing them for 1s (increases by 0.2s for every 100 Magic Power)."}], "builds": [{"lane": "MID", "winRate": 53.7, "pickRate": 2.72, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Mage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c7febdebe70929be98c7007af3cd0f3a.png", "attrs": ["+30 Magic Power", "+5% Cooldown Reduction", "+8 Magic Penetration"]}, "items": [{"name": "Glowing Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_df12c0f80844640a7b40cf64798be915.png"}, {"name": "Blood Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8635fde5353c9c68778e2aa59b931844.png"}, {"name": "Genius Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnre